{"content":[{"c":["ZEBADIAH"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. One of the sons of Beriah from Benjamin’s tribe (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.8.15","r":"1Chr.8.15","rawR":"1Chr.8.15","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.8.15","value":"1Chr.8.15"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 8:15"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["2. One of the sons of Elpaal from Benjamin’s tribe (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.8.17","r":"1Chr.8.17","rawR":"1Chr.8.17","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.8.17","value":"1Chr.8.17"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 8:17"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["3. One of the sons of Jeroham of Gedor, who came to David’s support at Ziklag (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.12.7","r":"1Chr.12.7","rawR":"1Chr.12.7","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.12.7","value":"1Chr.12.7"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 12:7"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["4. Korahite Levite descended from Asaph, third of Meshelemiah’s seven sons and a temple gatekeeper (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.26.2","r":"1Chr.26.2","rawR":"1Chr.26.2","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.26.2","value":"1Chr.26.2"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 26:2"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["5. Son of Asahel, Joab’s brother, who was the commander of the fourth division of David’s army (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.27.7","r":"1Chr.27.7","rawR":"1Chr.27.7","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.27.7","value":"1Chr.27.7"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 27:7"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["6. One of the Levites sent by Jehoshaphat into the cities of Judah to teach the law (",{"href":"?bref=2Chr.17.8","r":"2Chr.17.8","rawR":"2Chr.17.8","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Chr.17.8","value":"2Chr.17.8"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Chr 17:8"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["7. Ishmael’s son and one of the leaders of the Levites whom Jehoshaphat appointed as governor of civil affairs for the house of Judah (",{"href":"?bref=2Chr.19.11","r":"2Chr.19.11","rawR":"2Chr.19.11","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Chr.19.11","value":"2Chr.19.11"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Chr 19:11"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["8. Michael’s son from Shephatiah’s house, who returned with Ezra to Jerusalem following the exile (",{"href":"?bref=Ezra.8.8","r":"Ezra.8.8","rawR":"Ezra.8.8","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ezra.8.8","value":"Ezra.8.8"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ezr 8:8"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["9. One of the sons of Immer who renounced his foreign wife at Ezra’s command (",{"href":"?bref=Ezra.10.20","r":"Ezra.10.20","rawR":"Ezra.10.20","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ezra.10.20","value":"Ezra.10.20"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ezr 10:20"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Zebadiah","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"1 Chr 8:15","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.8.15","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.8.15","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.8.15"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 8:17","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.8.17","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.8.17","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.8.17"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 12:7","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.12.7","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.12.7","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.12.7"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 26:2","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.26.2","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.26.2","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.26.2"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 27:7","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.27.7","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.27.7","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.27.7"},{"anchorText":"2 Chr 17:8","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Chr.17.8","rawQueryValue":"2Chr.17.8","sourceRefExact":"2Chr.17.8"},{"anchorText":"2 Chr 19:11","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Chr.19.11","rawQueryValue":"2Chr.19.11","sourceRefExact":"2Chr.19.11"},{"anchorText":"Ezr 8:8","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Ezra.8.8","rawQueryValue":"Ezra.8.8","sourceRefExact":"Ezra.8.8"},{"anchorText":"Ezr 10:20","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Ezra.10.20","rawQueryValue":"Ezra.10.20","sourceRefExact":"Ezra.10.20"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"0ff8b2d150dbed944840a540b21fbc59de689682dac09b31cf011e573e20f5c0","sourceItemName":"Zebadiah","sourceItemOrder":46,"sourceMember":"Articles/Z.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Zebadiah","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Zebadiah","title":"Zebadiah","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}